{"availability":"available","full":"jawshfn/site-health-monitor","name":"site-health-monitor","description":"Full-stack website health monitor with live checks, response history, CI, and a React/FastAPI dashboard.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-23T16:17:07Z","updated":"2026-06-24T21:05:40Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://jawshfn.github.io/site-health-monitor/","topics":["fastapi","full-stack","github-actions","github-pages","javascript","pytest","python","react","uptime-monitoring"],"demo":"https://jawshfn.github.io/site-health-monitor/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T20:10:18.083Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T20:10:18.083Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T20:10:18.083Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T20:10:18.083Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Site Health Monitor is a full-stack monitoring dashboard for checking what a local HTTP checker observes when it reaches a website. It reports response time, redirects, DNS/IP information, saved check history, watchlist checks, observed status labels, and multi-stage diagnostics for DNS, TCP connection, and HTTP response behavior.","The app is designed as a portfolio project: practical enough to use locally, small enough to understand quickly, and tested through a GitHub Actions CI workflow.","The live GitHub Pages demo is frontend-only. Live website checks, saved sites, history, and dashboard data require the FastAPI backend to be running locally unless a backend is deployed separately later."],"features":["Check a website's observed availability, HTTP status, response time, redirects, and DNS/IP information","Show multi-stage reachability diagnostics for DNS, TCP connection, and HTTP response stages","Classify observed results as healthy, HTTP error, timeout, DNS failure, connection failure, invalid URL, or unknown error","Save monitored sites in a SQLite-backed watchlist with duplicate prevention and editable friendly names","Check one saved site or check all saved sites at once"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jawshfn/site-health-monitor/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"19a1c9904391f3ef55aa2c6d093c8b2c70103df4a41b0609a4f774beddbab5df","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T20:10:18.300Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T20:10:18.300Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Site Health Monitor is a full-stack monitoring dashboard for checking what a local HTTP checker observes when it reaches a website. It reports response time, redirects, DNS/IP information, saved check history, watchlist checks, observed status labels, and multi-stage diagnostics for DNS, TCP connection, and HTTP response behavior.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jawshfn/site-health-monitor/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"19a1c9904391f3ef55aa2c6d093c8b2c70103df4a41b0609a4f774beddbab5df","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jawshfn/site-health-monitor/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T20:10:18.301Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-06-24T21:05:40Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jawshfn/site-health-monitor/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T20:10:18.301Z","hash":"19a1c9904391f3ef55aa2c6d093c8b2c70103df4a41b0609a4f774beddbab5df","originalBytes":7134,"storedBytes":7134,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["check","history","sites","backend","saved","api","status","frontend","response","site","dns","http","url","website","search","connection","github","local","monitored","observed","time","venv","dashboard","data","get","locally","run","actions","build","checks","diagnostics","failure","health","label","powershell","python","python.exe","result","screenshots","scripts","summary","text","assets","checker","delete","demo","error","example","example.com","fastapi","healthy","install","latest","live","monitor","npm","null","pages","pip","post","project","re